#: ../../src/request.rst:5
msgid ":c:type:`uv_req_t` --- Base request"
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_req_t` —— 基础请求"

#: ../../src/request.rst:7
msgid "`uv_req_t` is the base type for all libuv request types."
msgstr "`uv_req_t` 是所有 libuv 请求类型的基础类型。"

#: ../../src/request.rst:9
msgid ""
"Structures are aligned so that any libuv request can be cast to "
"`uv_req_t`. All API functions defined here work with any request type."
msgstr ""
"结构体经过对齐处理，任何 libuv 请求都可以强制转换为 `uv_req_t`。此处定义"
"的所有 API 函数都适用于任何请求类型。"

#: ../../src/request.rst:14
msgid "Data types"
msgstr "数据类型"

#: ../../src/request.rst:18
msgid "The base libuv request structure."
msgstr "libuv 基础请求结构体。"

#: ../../src/request.rst:22
msgid "Union of all request types."
msgstr "所有请求类型的联合体。"

#: ../../src/request.rst:26
msgid "The kind of the libuv request."
msgstr "libuv 请求的种类。"

#: ../../src/request.rst:46
msgid "Public members"
msgstr "公开成员"

#: ../../src/request.rst:50
msgid "Space for user-defined arbitrary data. libuv does not use this field."
msgstr "用于存放用户自定义任意数据的空间。libuv 不使用此字段。"

#: ../../src/request.rst:54
msgid "The :c:enum:`uv_req_type`, indicating the type of the request. Readonly."
msgstr ":c:enum:`uv_req_type`，指示请求的类型。只读。"

#: ../../src/request.rst:58
msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

#: ../../src/request.rst:62
msgid ""
"Macro that expands to a series of invocations of `iter_macro` for each of"
" the request types. `iter_macro` is invoked with two arguments: the name "
"of the `uv_req_type` element without the `UV_` prefix, and the name of "
"the corresponding structure type without the `uv_` prefix and `_t` "
"suffix."
msgstr ""
"该宏会针对每种请求类型展开为对 `iter_macro` 的一系列调用。`iter_macro` "
"调用时接收两个参数：一个是 `uv_req_type` 元素去掉 `UV_` 前缀后的名称，另"
"一个是相应结构体类型去掉 `uv_` 前缀和 `_t` 后缀后的名称。"

#: ../../src/request.rst:70
msgid ""
"Cancel a pending request. Fails if the request is executing or has "
"finished executing. Write requests are an exception: cancellation of a "
"write that is already in progress will attempt to interrupt it (the "
"callback may report a partial write), and cancellation of an already-"
"completed write is a successful no-op."
msgstr ""
"取消一个尚未完成的请求。若请求正在执行或已执行完毕，则取消失败。写请求是"
"一个例外：取消一个正在进行中的写操作会尝试中断它（回调可能报告部分写入），"
"而取消一个已完成的写操作则是一次成功的空操作。"

#: ../../src/request.rst:76
msgid "Returns 0 on success, or an error code < 0 on failure."
msgstr "成功时返回 0，失败时返回小于 0 的错误码。"

#: ../../src/request.rst:78
msgid ""
"Only cancellation of :c:type:`uv_write_t`, :c:type:`uv_fs_t`, "
":c:type:`uv_getaddrinfo_t`, :c:type:`uv_getnameinfo_t`, "
":c:type:`uv_random_t` and :c:type:`uv_work_t` requests is currently "
"supported."
msgstr ""
"目前仅支持取消 :c:type:`uv_write_t`、:c:type:`uv_fs_t`、"
":c:type:`uv_getaddrinfo_t`、:c:type:`uv_getnameinfo_t`、"
":c:type:`uv_random_t` 和 :c:type:`uv_work_t` 请求。"

#: ../../src/request.rst:83
msgid ""
"Cancelled requests have their callbacks invoked some time in the future. "
"It's **not** safe to free the memory associated with the request until "
"the callback is called."
msgstr ""
"被取消的请求，其回调会在未来的某个时刻被调用。在回调被调用之前，释放与该"
"请求关联的内存是 **不** 安全的。"

#: ../../src/request.rst:87
msgid "Here is how cancellation is reported to the callback:"
msgstr "取消操作通过以下方式报告给回调："

#: ../../src/request.rst:89
msgid ""
"A :c:type:`uv_fs_t` request has its req->result field set to "
"`UV_ECANCELED`."
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_fs_t` 请求的 req->result 字段会被设置为 `UV_ECANCELED`。"

#: ../../src/request.rst:91
msgid ""
"A :c:type:`uv_work_t`, :c:type:`uv_getaddrinfo_t`, "
":c:type:`uv_getnameinfo_t` or :c:type:`uv_random_t` request has its "
"callback invoked with status == `UV_ECANCELED`."
msgstr ""
":c:type:`uv_work_t`、:c:type:`uv_getaddrinfo_t`、"
":c:type:`uv_getnameinfo_t` 或 :c:type:`uv_random_t` 请求的回调会以 "
"status == `UV_ECANCELED` 被调用。"

#: ../../src/request.rst:95
msgid ""
"A :c:type:`uv_write_t` request has its callback invoked with status == "
"`UV_ECANCELED`. Use :c:func:`uv_write_nwritten` from the callback to "
"determine how many bytes were written before cancellation. Fully "
"cancelled writes (where no bytes were written) may have their callbacks "
"called out of order with respect to other writes on the same stream. Note"
" that cancelled writes may still succeed or fail with other errors if the"
" kernel finished processing the write before the cancellation took "
"effect."
msgstr ""
":c:type:`uv_write_t` 请求的回调会以 status == `UV_ECANCELED` 被调用。可在"
"回调中使用 :c:func:`uv_write_nwritten` 来确定在取消发生之前写入了多少字"
"节。完全被取消的写操作（未写入任何字节）的回调，相对于同一流上的其他写操"
"作可能乱序调用。注意，如果内核在取消生效之前已完成对该写操作的处理，被取"
"消的写操作仍可能成功，或因其他错误而失败。"

#: ../../src/request.rst:106
msgid ""
"Returns the size of the given request type. Useful for FFI binding "
"writers who don't want to know the structure layout."
msgstr ""
"返回给定请求类型的大小。对于不想了解结构体布局的 FFI 绑定编写者很有用。"

#: ../../src/request.rst:111
msgid "Returns `req->data`."
msgstr "返回 `req->data`。"

#: ../../src/request.rst:117
msgid "Sets `req->data` to `data`."
msgstr "将 `req->data` 设置为 `data`。"

#: ../../src/request.rst:123
msgid "Returns `req->type`."
msgstr "返回 `req->type`。"

#: ../../src/request.rst:129
msgid ""
"Returns the name for the equivalent struct for a given request type, e.g."
" `\"connect\"` (as in :c:type:`uv_connect_t`) for `UV_CONNECT`."
msgstr ""
"返回与给定请求类型相对应的结构体的名称，例如 `\"connect\"` （即 "
":c:type:`uv_connect_t` 中的名称）对应 `UV_CONNECT`。"

#: ../../src/request.rst:132
msgid "If no such request type exists, this returns `NULL`."
msgstr "如果不存在这样的请求类型，则返回 `NULL`。"
